 **Data Structures:**
-*   **Wang Cubes:** A set of 3D textured cubes. Each cube has a "cube tiling" (face colors) and "cube contents" (internal pattern) [S1].
-*   **Cube Sets:** A collection of Wang Cubes assigned to objects or regions.
